All of you, go after them!

260
00:15:21,840 --> 00:15:23,140
Go on, get her.

261
00:15:23,500 --> 00:15:25,618
You've got a score to settle, right?

262
00:15:27,340 --> 00:15:28,700
She's all yours, Runco.

263
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,577
Please take care of things here.

264
00:15:30,660 --> 00:15:31,490
Okay.

265
00:15:44,880 --> 00:15:47,537
Those buggers are going
to slaughter all of them.

266
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:48,914
Let's call for backup.

267
00:15:49,120 --> 00:15:53,414
As long as we can get more support,
we can go back and win this damn war.

268
00:15:54,260 --> 00:15:56,025
What did you just say, Yugaki?

269
00:15:56,560 --> 00:15:58,360
The war's already begun.

270
00:15:58,700 --> 00:16:00,480
You can cut the tough talk.

271
00:16:00,700 --> 00:16:03,237
You vermin can go ahead
and squash each other.

272
00:16:03,320 --> 00:16:05,377
We don't give a damn about you anymore.

273
00:16:05,460 --> 00:16:07,737
We're going to be creatures from now on.

274
00:16:07,820 --> 00:16:08,650
Huh?

275
00:16:08,733 --> 00:16:09,597
What the hell does that mean?

276
00:16:09,680 --> 00:16:13,504
Us aliens will join hands with
the creatures and live in harmony.

277
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:14,995
Consider it a merger.

278
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:19,080
We've come to an understanding
beyond the Stargate, if you will.

279
00:16:19,620 --> 00:16:22,160
Manami, thanks for all you did for us.

280
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,419
I hope you at least die peacefully.

281
00:16:28,700 --> 00:16:29,800
Oh, bitch!

282
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,520
Sorry, Miss Manami.

283
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:38,140
You really are so very useless.

284
00:16:38,680 --> 00:16:39,520
I'm sorry.

285
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:46,560
Forget it. Just go.

286
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:50,300
Miss Manami... Beat it. Go on. Now leave.

287
00:17:21,960 --> 00:17:26,057
well now little missy here to
settle the score huh I can't

288
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:29,237
forgive you for what you did
so what What you gonna do,

289
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:30,150
then?

290
00:17:30,233 --> 00:17:31,700
You gonna kill me, hun? Huh?

291
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,294
Bet you can't, though.

292
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:36,600
You're no cafe maid, Missy.

293
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:38,200
I am a maid.

294
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:40,800
You're a stealthy ninja. I'm a maid!

295
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:43,660
A wannabe maid who's a
useless piece of shit!

296
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:47,180
Please stop, Bronco.

297
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:51,144
If we continue to let her live,
she'll just come attack us again.

298
00:17:51,540 --> 00:17:53,540
No doubt you've got that right.

299
00:17:55,380 --> 00:17:57,000
It's a shame, isn't it?

300
00:17:58,920 --> 00:18:01,137
Nagomi, I need you to please step aside.

301
00:18:01,220 --> 00:18:02,102
I'm not moving.

302
00:18:02,280 --> 00:18:03,917
Think you're over there protecting me?

303
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,880
What a fucking insult,
ninja maid. Move it.

304
00:18:08,460 --> 00:18:10,420
My bad against your gun, huh?

305
00:18:10,900 --> 00:18:12,100
Pitch me a good one.

306
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:15,118
You really want to fight that badly?

307
00:18:15,280 --> 00:18:17,180
An Akiba maid has got to fight.

308
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:19,197
That's not what being a maid is about.

309
00:18:19,280 --> 00:18:20,557
You've got to be kidding me.

310
00:18:20,640 --> 00:18:24,737
A maid would rather have a glorious
death over living in utter disgrace.

311
00:18:24,820 --> 00:18:27,817
If you die, all your masters
will be sad, won't they?

312
00:18:27,900 --> 00:18:30,841
Ramen changes over time
and so should Akiba maids!

313
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:33,431
What the hell does that mean, ninja freak?

314
00:18:33,620 --> 00:18:36,400
Your sister must be crying down in hell.

315
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:39,548
Nerula said I should
stay just the way I am.

316
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:42,537
So there's no point in us
killing the likes of you.

317
00:18:42,620 --> 00:18:43,540
Fucking wuss.

318
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:46,097
You just don't have what it
takes to fight to the death.

319
00:18:46,180 --> 00:18:49,300
I will never forgive you,
but I won't kill you.

320
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:52,128
That's the kind of maid
I'm going to be now.

321
00:18:52,660 --> 00:18:53,836
Enough of your shit.

322
00:18:54,060 --> 00:18:56,531
Bright-eyed youthful opinion time is over!

323
00:18:57,660 --> 00:18:58,490
Ah!

324
00:19:01,320 --> 00:19:02,360
Live, dammit!

325
00:19:02,500 --> 00:19:03,559
Stop your killing!

326
00:19:03,700 --> 00:19:07,097
If you're a real maid, then feel
the lovey-dovey heart within you!

327
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:08,717
You're a stealthy ninja, ain't ya?

328
00:19:08,800 --> 00:19:11,937
Why'd I have to hear that dumbass
shit from a fucking ninja, huh?

329
00:19:12,020 --> 00:19:13,420
I told you I'm a maid!

330
00:19:13,740 --> 00:19:15,400
Lovey-dovey heart!

331
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:32,457
You're such a big pain in the ass.

332
00:19:32,540 --> 00:19:34,580
Pig hunting's over now, ninja!

333
00:19:35,820 --> 00:19:37,960
Time to get back to outer space.

334
00:19:49,280 --> 00:19:51,637
I'm now gonna be my own maid.

335
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:53,860
One that Nerula would be proud of.

336
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:56,617
Welcome home, Nogomi!

337
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:57,840
You're a true maid.

338
00:19:59,780 --> 00:20:00,780
I'm back now.

339
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:11,800
Stinks like creatures in here.

340
00:20:12,480 --> 00:20:15,186
Ugaki, I can see that
collar around your neck.

341
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:18,400
I wouldn't underestimate me if I were you.

342
00:20:18,720 --> 00:20:21,517
Look at you now, all big
and mighty with your gun.

343
00:20:21,600 --> 00:20:22,430
You afraid of me?

344
00:20:22,513 --> 00:20:25,166
I won't let you make a
fool out of me anymore.

345
00:20:25,600 --> 00:20:28,953
Careful now or you might start
sounding like a real maid.

346
00:20:29,240 --> 00:20:32,440
Now get ready to become a stardust memory.

347
00:20:47,860 --> 00:20:49,897
Damn, that hurts.

348
00:20:49,980 --> 00:20:53,340
I never thought it would
hurt this much to live.

349
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:06,777
I see.

350
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:09,180
A job well done, Ms. Ugaki.

351
00:21:13,800 --> 00:21:14,860
And so,

352
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:18,517
Manami's plan to take over Made
Alien headquarters and wage

353
00:21:18,600 --> 00:21:22,160
war on the Creatureland Group
ended in absolute failure.

354
00:21:22,640 --> 00:21:26,346
A faction of the Made Alien Group
that opposed the merger broke

355
00:21:26,900 --> 00:21:31,657
away, and the second generation had
Yugaki once again returned to power.

356
00:21:31,740 --> 00:21:33,540
However, having lost their

357
00:21:34,160 --> 00:21:34,990
Warhawks,

358
00:21:35,100 --> 00:21:39,057
Made Alien had no choice but to agree
to all of Creatureland's demands,

359
00:21:39,140 --> 00:21:40,220
dashing Yugaki's

360
00:21:41,100 --> 00:21:43,037
hopes for a merger on equal terms.

361
00:21:43,120 --> 00:21:43,950
Consequently,

362
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:46,297
Creatureland swallowed
Made Alien whole in the

363
00:21:46,380 --> 00:21:49,860
and the Maid alien group
effectively disappeared.

364
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:55,980
No one knows what became of Manami,
the Maid called the Crimson Supernova.

365
00:21:57,880 --> 00:22:01,940
Thus, Akihabara entered an era
of Creatureland group domination.

366
00:22:05,740 --> 00:22:08,446
They would have been
better off roasted whole.

367
00:22:24,840 --> 00:22:30,360
Thank you for listening to this video.
